# Ecosystem

## Workspace

`~/ai/agents/tddimplementer/` — local `plans/`.

## Target repo

User attaches each session. Run **focused** tests when possible:

- `pytest tests/unit/test_foo.py`
- `npm test -- --testPathPattern=...`
- Document command in plan

## Agent matrix

| Agent | Tests | Production |
|-------|-------|------------|
| **tddimplementer** | Read-only; never edit | Minimal to pass |
| **refactoragent** | Never edit | Refactor; baseline must pass |
| **automated-test-creator** | Write | Testability only |
| **project-rescue** | May write system test gate | Rescue |

## Status

Log when user ends session (shared-tracking).

